        "agentNeeds": [
          {
            "name": "Macro Butler (plan matcher)",
            "job": "Scores quiz answers into one of six plans, sets box size and cadence, splits a household into profiles, and writes a two-line 'why this plan' note from owner-approved templates. Routes medical, allergy or eating-disorder signals to a person. Chat-based personal plans hand off to the AI Coach (Play 6).",
            "onScreen": "Quiz result card: 'Why we picked Lean Bulk for you', labelled 'Drafted by Macro Butler from your answers', plus the household split."
