          {
            "name": "Nutrition Data Agent",
            "job": "Computes est. macros for the ~31 plan SKUs from recipes, cooked yields and Health Canada CNF values. Writes them to Shopify metafields and queues each panel for a nutritionist's sign-off. Flags regulated claim wording (high protein, low carb, GLP-1).",
            "onScreen": "'est.' macro chips on every plan card and meal row; team tile 'Macro sign-off: 9 of 31 plan SKUs verified'."
