          "note": "Estimates, excluding Minastech's fee. Setup: nutritionist review of plan rules and ~31 SKUs $2,500; lab analysis of top 8 SKUs $1,600; plan photos and video $1,200; label design and print $800; staff training $900. Year-1 running (Dec-Oct) ~$81.9K (~$7,450 a month): software $6.2K (subscription app ~$200/mo, Klaviyo email+SMS share ~$250/mo, AI tokens ~$100/mo, reviews app $15/mo); paid ads $15K (~175 subscribers x ~$85 CAC); switch and referral credits $6.2K; Meal Butler lead 12 h/wk $13.8K; part-time cook/packer from Feb $25.7K; box labels $2.1K; discount leakage on existing buyers who switch $13K. At year-2 volume, running costs rise to about $10K a month (~$120K a year). Route delivery stays customer-paid ($20-$35) and covers the $8-$14 cost per stop."
