            ],
            "displayFont": "Fraunces",
            "bodyFont": "Inter",
            "layout": "Mobile-first single column at 375px; 12-column grid at 1024px+. Quiz is a centred white card (max 720px, 16px radius) with a dot tracker and full-pill options at least 44px tall. Plan cards sit in a 1/2/3-column grid with a 4px left rule in the plan accent. The builder is two panes on desktop with a sticky right-hand bag; on mobile the bag becomes a bottom sheet with a sticky bar ('14 of 14 meals · $182.02'). Freezer Fill and Household are full-width bands; trust is a dark rounded panel. Soft shadows, 12-16px radii, no horizontal scroll.",
            "tone": "Plain, warm and specific, like the family butcher at the counter. Canadian spelling (fibre, flavour, favourite), short sentences, no hype words, no emoji. 'We' is the J&W kitchen. Every macro says 'est.'; concept items carry an amber 'Concept' tag; GLP-1 copy always says it is food, not medical advice."
          },
          "sections": [
            {
              "name": "Cut-off bar",
