              "name": "Hero",
              "purpose": "State the promise and the price gap.",
              "content": "Background ../assets/img/meals.jpg (alt 'Meal Butler meals: salmon with quinoa, chicken with broccoli, flank steak with green beans'). Eyebrow: 'Goal plans by J&W Meal Butler'. H1: 'Pick your goal. We'll cook the plan.' Sub: 'Six goal plans made from Meal Butler meals we already cook, portion and freeze at our Ontario-inspected plant in Scarborough. Salt and sugar free, with no added oils. Skip or swap any week.' Buttons: 'Find my plan (about 60 seconds)' and 'See the six plans'. Trust chips: '4.8 on Google · 611 reviews' · 'Butchers since 1995' · 'Ontario-inspected plant since 2008' · '30K on Instagram'. Floating price card: 'From $7.30 a meal with Subscribe & Save. Most plans $9.56 to $13.02 a meal. Premium GTA goal plans list at about $16 to $27 a meal (public prices, Oct 2026).' Amber 'Concept' tag."
            },
            {
              "name": "How it works",
              "purpose": "Four-step explainer.",
              "content": "H2 'How it works'. 1 'Take the quiz. Goal, training, who's eating.' 2 'Get your plan. Meals, est. macros and a price per meal.' 3 'Pick a rhythm. Weekly, every 2 weeks, or a monthly Freezer Fill.' 4 'Stay in control. Skip, swap or pause until Sunday night.'"
            },
            {
              "name": "Find my plan (quiz)",
              "purpose": "The core Power Kitchen idea in J&W's voice; routes to a plan, size, rhythm and route.",
              "content": "H2 'Find my plan'. 8 steps with dot tracker, Back/Next. Q1 'What's your main goal?' Lose fat · Build muscle · Train hard (5+ days) · Eat fewer starches · I'm eating less on a GLP-1 medicine · Feed the whole family (note: 'Good. We'll build around that.'). Q2 'How many days a week do you train?' 0 · 1–2 · 3–4 · 5–6 · 7. Q3 'Who's eating?' Just me · Two adults · A family with kids (note on 2+: 'We can pack everyone's plan in one box.'). Q4 'How many lunches and dinners should we cover each week?' 5 · 7 · 10 (most popular) · 14. Q5 'How often should we deliver?' Every week · Every 2 weeks (most popular) · Once a month (Freezer Fill) (note: 'Our meals are frozen in vacuum packs, so a month at once works.'). Q6 'Anything to leave out?' multi-chips Fish · Red meat · Eggs and dairy · Spicy · Rice (note: 'Allergies? Call us at (416) 298-1350 before you order.'). Q7 'Are you switching from another meal service?' No · Goodfood · Factor · LiveFit · Another meal-prep service (yes → 'Welcome. We'll take $25 off your first subscribed box (concept offer).'). Q8 'Where should we deliver?' select of JWC.cities() + 'I'll pick up at Brimley Rd'; shows the route live, e.g. 'Toronto: Wednesday route (GTA 2), $20, $100 minimum'. Loading line 1.2s: 'Building your plan from this week's Meal Butler menu…'. Routing: GLP-1 → GLP-1 Companion; family or 'Feed the whole family' → Busy Family / household; fewer starches → Protein & Greens; build muscle with 5+ days or train hard → Athlete; build muscle → Lean Bulk; lose fat → Lean. Box size = meals per week x weeks per delivery (1, 2 or 4)."
            },
            {
