            "displayFont": "Barlow Condensed",
            "bodyFont": "Inter",
            "layout": "Mobile-first single column with a 16px gutter, max width 1160px. White sticky sub-header under the concept bar: J&W logo (../assets/img/jw-logo.jpg) + 'PRO PARTNERS', anchor links, and a two-way switch 'Become a partner | Partner portal (demo)'. Hero is two-column on desktop (copy left, freezer teaser right) over ../assets/img/meals.jpg with a #0E2340 overlay at ~70%. Sections alternate canvas and deep-navy bands. Cards have a 16px radius and soft shadow. Barlow Condensed 600/700 uppercase with wide tracking for headings and big numbers. Tables become stacked cards under 640px. Sticky order bar at the bottom on mobile, sitting above the framework dock. Tap targets 44px. No horizontal scroll at 375px. Google Fonts: family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700.",
            "tone": "Plain, confident and trade-friendly. Numbers first. Talks like a family butcher who knows gym owners. Short sentences, Canadian spelling, no hype."
          },
          "sections": [
            {
              "name": "S0 Sub-header",
              "purpose": "Brand, navigation and the switch between the public partner page and the demo partner portal.",
              "content": "Logo + 'PRO PARTNERS'. Links: How it works · Pricing · Catalogue · Apply. Switch: 'Become a partner' / 'Partner portal (demo)'. Button: 'Apply in 2 minutes'."
            },
            {
              "name": "S1 Hero",
              "purpose": "State the offer to business buyers in one line and route them to apply or to the freezer builder.",
              "content": "Eyebrow: 'J&W PRO PARTNERS'. H1: 'Feed the people you train.' Sub: 'Cooked, weighed and vacuum-sealed in our Ontario-inspected plant in Scarborough. Partner pricing by the case, standing weekly drops on our own routes, and a freezer on loan once you're rolling.' Buttons: 'Apply in 2 minutes' (solid navy) and 'Build your freezer' (white outline). Small line: 'For gyms, CrossFit boxes, trainers, clinics, supplement shops and teams in Ontario.' Background ../assets/img/meals.jpg with navy overlay."
            },
            {
              "name": "S2 Proof strip",
              "purpose": "Real J&W proof in place of a partner-logo wall.",
              "content": "Four chips: '4.8★ · 611 Google reviews' · 'Ontario-inspected plant since 2008' · 'No added salt, sugar or oil in Meal Butler food' · 'Family butchers since 1995 · wholesale roots to 1973'."
            },
            {
              "name": "S3 WHO WE SUPPLY",
              "purpose": "Audience router: six segment cards, each loading a real starter order.",
              "content": "Intro: 'Six kinds of partners, one kitchen. Pick yours and we'll load a starter order.' Each card has a 'See starter order' button (loads preset into cart/catalogue, scrolls there, toast 'Starter order for {segment} loaded. Change anything.'). 1 'Gyms & CrossFit boxes': 'A front-desk freezer of grab-and-go meals. Members buy after class. You keep the margin.' Preset: 48-Meal Freezer Restock. 2 'Personal trainers & coaches': 'Order your clients' week in one case and hand it over at the session.' Preset: Trainer Client Week x 3. 3 'Physio, dietitian & weight-loss clinics': 'Smaller portions, high protein, nothing added. Your dietitian picks the menu.' Preset: Clinic Small-Portion 12-Pack x 2 + Breakfast Box of 24. 4 'Supplement & health shops': 'Put fast-moving protein next to the tubs. We restock every week.' Preset: Mixed 24-Meal Case + Breakfast Box of 24. 5 'Boxing, MMA & fight gyms': 'Portions weighed to the ounce, for athletes who count every gram.' Preset: Fight Camp 12-Pack x 2 + 1 Case of Portioned Chicken Breast (4 kg, 4 oz). 6 'Teams & academies': 'Travel-day and camp meals, invoiced to the club.' Preset: Mixed 24-Meal Case x 2 + Premium Chicken Burgers 25-pack. Small print on card 6: 'Raising money for your team? Ask us about our fundraiser program.'"
            },
            {
              "name": "S4 BUILD YOUR FREEZER (wow)",
              "purpose": "Make the partner economics tangible and personal in one interaction.",
              "content": "Deep-navy band. Intro: 'Tell us who you are. We'll fill a freezer, put your name on it and show you what it earns.' Inputs: 'Your business name' (placeholder 'Brimley Barbell Club'), 'City' (select from JWC.cities(), default Scarborough), 'Meals a week' slider 12-120 step 12 (default 48), mix chips 'Balanced · Lean · Fighter · Clinic' (Balanced = 48-Meal Restock mix; Lean = Turkey, Tilapia, Tenders, Souvlaki; Fighter = Tenders 4 oz + Teriyaki 4 oz; Clinic = the three 4 oz meals). Output: CSS glass-door freezer, 4 shelves filling with JWC.img(p,200) thumbnails, header 'FUELLED BY J&W AT {NAME}'. Receipt: 'Your tier: Pro · 20% off cooked food' / 'You pay: $577.06 a week' / 'Members pay (our web price): $721.32' / 'You keep: $144.26 a week · about $7,213 a year' / 'Your drop: GTA 2 · Wednesday · order by Sunday' (from JWC.routesFor(city); pickup if none) / 'Freezer: on loan from J&W' if ≥ $300 a week, else 'Freezer: on loan once you average $300 a week'. Buttons: 'Order this freezer fill' (adds mix at tier price to JWC.cart, opens cart) and 'Apply with this plan' (pre-fills S10). Small print: 'Web prices from jwfoods.com. Partner discounts are Concept pricing. Margins are estimates. Demo only.'"
