            {
              "name": "Build your box (the wow)",
              "purpose": "Points-budget builder with live box visual",
              "content": "H2 'Build your box'. Sub 'Tap to add. Your box fills as you go.' Presets row 'Start from a ready box:' Lean & simple (Starter: half case chicken, ground chicken x3, ground turkey, top sirloin x2, sockeye x2 = 27 pts, $134.96, ~10.1 lb) · Wild Fork switcher (Family: 4 kg case 6 oz, Wagyu/Kobe ground x2, ground beef 5 lb, top sirloin x4, sockeye x3, pork tenderloin = 48 pts, $241.48, ~21.3 lb, ~68 servings) · Greek Sunday (Family: Ontario lamb chops, Spartan Loukaniko x2, ground lamb, pork tenderloin, half case chicken, top sirloin x4, ground chicken x2, bacon, Wagyu/Kobe ground = 47 pts) · Steak night (Freezer Fill: ribeye 10-pack, NY striploin x4, Wagyu striploin, picanha x2, Wagyu/Kobe ground x2 = 66 pts, $328.98, ~13 lb) · Start empty. Filters: All · Chicken · Beef · Pork · Lamb & game · Fish. Points = round(price/5): 4 kg chicken case $85 = 17; half case $48 = 10; ground chicken $9.99 = 2; thighs $18.99 = 4; drumsticks $9.99 = 2; wings $14.99 = 3; chicken burgers 25-pack $35.50 = 7; marinated chicken case $100 = 20; ground turkey $15.99 = 3; top sirloin $10 = 2; NY striploin single $15 = 3 (case 8 x 8-9 oz $110 = 22); ribeye single 11-12 oz $24.50 = 5; ribeye 10-pack $175 = 35; tenderloin $19 = 4; picanha $14.50 = 3; Wagyu striploin $35 = 7; Wagyu/Kobe ground $14.99 = 3; ground brisket $10.99 = 2; ground beef 5 lb $40 = 8; short ribs $35 = 7; pork tenderloin $15 = 3; pork chop case $36 = 7; Spartan Loukaniko $11.50 = 2; bacon 1 lb $9 = 2; lamb chops $52 = 10; ground lamb $14.99 = 3; bison ribeye 6 oz $18.50 = 4; ground bison $16 = 3; venison 6 oz $19.99 = 4; wild sockeye $10.50 = 2. Card: photo, short name with J&W listing title in small grey, pack, price, '$/lb' tag, point chip, Add button that becomes a +/- stepper. Steak cards: thickness segmented control 1\" · 1¼\" · 1½\" (default 1¼\", saved as the cart note). Box panel: CSS-grid tiles, meter '32 of 48 points', 'Weight 14.2 lb (est.)', 'About 45 servings', 'Shelf value $158.47', 'Your price $239 a box', 'Free for life: Teriyaki cooked chicken 4 x 4 oz', 'Delivery: free on your route day'. Over budget: 'You're 4 points over. Extra points are $5 each ($20), or remove something.' Under: '16 points left. Up to 5 roll to your next box.' Full: lid closes with the laurel seal 'Packed at 2201 Brimley Rd', toast 'Box full. Nice work.' Button 'Review my box'. Below: 'Add Meal Butler extras (regular prices, outside your points)': chicken-breast-souvlaki 4 oz $4.62, 6oz-fully-cooked-meatballs 4 oz $2.19, copy-of-feta-omelette-cups-cooked-portioned-2-pkg $5.25, soup-chicken-lemon-soup $8.99, chicken-souvlaki-broccoli-sweet-potato-chunks 4 oz $13.99. EXTRA ITEMS not in JWCAT (copy exactly from research/jw-catalog.json): portioned-4kg-cases-of-frozen-chicken-breasts 'CASE of  PORTIONED CHICKEN BREASTS' 6oz Portions $85 / HALF CASE (2KG BAG - Random Portions) $48 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/breast.png?v=1475243729 ; 1lb-ground-chicken 'GROUND - CHICKEN BREAST - 1LB BAG' $9.99 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/image_459dce90-49e5-4403-af41-2fbcc922916d.jpg?v=1624982451 ; chicken-boneless-leg-meat 'CHICKEN THIGHS - BONELESS SKINLESS' REGULAR 1BG $18.99 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/bonelesslegsmeat.jpg?v=1585160704 ; 2-5-3-lb-bag-chicken-drumsticks 'CHICKEN DRUMSTICKS' 2-3.0 lbs Bag $9.99 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/23e9fef7-d8b6-4494-a54b-e4c534d6406d.jpg?v=1585161980 ; chicken-wings 'CHICKEN WINGS' 2LB BAG - DRUMS & FLATS $14.99 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/wings.png?v=1475243586 ; chicken-burgers-1 'Premium Chicken Burgers — 25 Pack (6 oz each)' $35.50 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/files/chicken-burger-on-cutting-board.png?v=1782841639 ; ground-turkey 'ONTARIO GROUND TURKEY BREAST -1LB BAG' $15.99 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/1Ground-Turkey-5038914.jpg?v=1469735301 ; aaa-beef-sir