3762 ; copy-of-salmon-fillets-5-6oz-portion-canadian-atlantic 'SALMON SOCKEYE - SKIN-ON, Canadian WILD' $10.50 img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/image_0aea0c6d-5b87-4eef-b8e4-6ee2ac91e53b.jpg?v=1637100436 ; half-lamb-ontario 'HALF LAMB ONTARIO' $250 (no image; reuse whole-lamb photo labelled 'Half lamb'). Pack weights (lb, est.) for the counter: 4 kg case 8.82; half case 4.41; 1 lb bags 1.0; thighs 2.75; drumsticks 2.5; wings 2.0; chicken burgers 9.38; marinated case 8.82; top sirloin 0.47; striploin 0.53 (case 4.25); ribeye single 0.72; ribeye 10-pack 7.19; tenderloin 0.44; picanha 0.59; Wagyu striploin 0.53; ground beef bulk 5.0; short ribs 2.0; pork tenderloin 2.5; pork chop case 3.75; sausages ~1.0; bacon 1.0; lamb chops ~1.5; bison/venison 0.375; sockeye 0.375. Servings = lb x 16 / 5."
