                "match": "servings|how much meat|pounds|\\blb\\b|weigh",
                "reply": "Starter is up to 45 servings (about 10–14 lb on a mixed box), Family up to 80 (17–25 lb) and Freezer Fill up to 110 (25–34 lb). These are estimates at 5 oz raw per serving. Steak-heavy boxes weigh less."
