              {
                "match": "grass|organic|hormone|antibiotic",
                "reply": "Our chicken is Ontario-raised, air-chilled and grain-fed, with no hormones or antibiotics. Our beef is graded AAA, with Wagyu and Canadian Prime available. We don't make grass-fed claims on the Club menu. Ask the counter about a specific cut."
              },
              {
                "match": "outside ontario|other province|calgary|vancouver|montreal|ship to",
