            "job": "Builds lists of GTA employers with 50+ staff along J&W's route corridors (Scarborough, Markham, North York, Vaughan, Mississauga). Drafts CASL-compliant intro emails to HR and books tastings. Watches live accounts for falling participation and suggests save offers. A person approves every message.",
