              "content": "H2: 'Let's feed your team.' Sub: 'Book a free tasting and we'll bring 8 meals to your site on our route day. Or call us at (416) 298-1350.'\nButton: 'Book a tasting' (scrolls to the hero form).\nSmall print: 'J&W Foods · 2201 Brimley Rd, Unit 1, Scarborough · Family-run since 1995.'"
