          "teamView": [
            {
              "name": "At Work desk header",
              "content": "Title: 'At Work desk · week of Oct 19'. Caption: 'Sample data: a typical week about 9 months in'.\nKPI strip:\n- Live accounts 14\n- Pilots 2, plus any created on this device\n- Items ordered this week 648 (31% company-funded)\n- Freezers 6 (2 low)\n- Live countdown to the Sunday 11:59 pm cut-off\n- This month so far $24,900"
            },
            {
              "name": "Employer accounts table",
              "content": "Columns: Account | Site · route | On site | Perk | Took part | Items this week | Freezer | Health. All names are fictional.\n\nRows:\n1. Northline Logistics | Markham · Fri GTA 4 | 140 | $3 off, max 5/wk | 31% | 96 | Yes, 68% stocked | Good\n2. Milliken Precision Plastics | Scarborough · Wed GTA 2 | 210 | 2 lunches covered | 27% | 118 | Yes, 41% (low) | Good\n3. Don Mills Design Co. | North York · Wed GTA 2 | 45 | $4 off | 29% (was 44%) | 31 | none | Watch\n4. Eastgate Care Residence | Scarborough · Wed GTA 2 | 120 (3 shifts) | $5 off nights | 24% | 64 | Yes, 55% | Good\n5. Vaughan Cold Storage | Vaughan · Fri GTA 4 | 95 | $2 off | 22% | 44 | none | Good\n6. Brightpath Software (pilot, week 2 of 4) | Toronto · Wed GTA 2 | 38 | Everything on Wednesdays | 61% | 52 | none | Pilot\n7. Ajax Fleet Services | Ajax · Tue GTA 1 | 80 | $3 off | 26% | 42 | Yes, 80% | Good\n8. Mississauga Print Works | Mississauga · Wed GTA 2 | 60 | $2.50 off | 20% | 26 | none | Watch (Starter tier)\n\nBehaviour:\n- Pilots created in flow 2 appear at the top with a 'New' tag.\n- Clicking a row opens a drawer with the allowance settings, a 6-week participation sparkline and the invoice preview.\n- Staff orders and freezer buys from this device add to the Northline item count."
