          "note": "Setup: branded sleeves, insulated liners and card stock for the first 1,000 gifts ($2,400); photos of the levels and certificate design ($700); 20 tasting boxes for prospects at cost ($1,200); card and label printer ($400); 20 h of setup time ($800). Monthly average, about $29K in year 1: ads on LinkedIn, Meta and Google $730 (peaks at $1,500 in Nov-Dec and Sep-Oct, $350 otherwise); Gift Desk hours $900 (20 h/week in Nov-Dec, 6 h/week otherwise, at $25/h loaded); logo cards and sleeves at about $3 a gift ($310); extra December van runs ($200); seasonal packer ($150); software and AI ($125: bulk certificate app, invoicing, shared prospecting data, Claude API). Year 2 is about $45K/yr. Excludes Minastech's fee."
