            },
            {
              "name": "Who it's for",
              "purpose": "Omaha's three program cards, rewritten for GTA buyers",
              "content": "H2 'One studio, every kind of thank-you'. Card 'Employees': 'Holiday gifts, work anniversaries, safety milestones and welcome-aboard boxes. Send to the office or to each home.' Card 'Clients': 'Closing gifts for realtors and brokers. Thank-yous from accountants, contractors and clinics. Your name on the card, our steaks in the box.' Card 'Team moments': 'Employee Appreciation Day, Lunar New Year, Greek Easter, the summer long weekends. Plan them once and we'll remind you.' Simple line icons."
            },
            {
              "name": "Pick a level",
              "purpose": "The gift ladder on real J&W boxes, every level under the CRA limit",
              "content": "H2 'Pick a level'. Sub: 'Every level stays under the CRA's $500 yearly limit for non-cash gifts. Send one box to everyone, or give a Pick-a-Box certificate and let each person choose at their level.' THANK YOU $90: Ultimate BBQ Dad Pack $84.99 ('AAA T-bone, AAA tenderloin, teriyaki salmon and a 2 kg bag of Korean BBQ chicken tenders'); Girls Night Box $89.99 ('Chicken, pork and shrimp souvlaki, 4 top sirloin steaks, spanakopita and party bites'); Meal Butler Taster $87.93 [Concept] ('7 cooked, portioned meals. Salt and sugar free, no added oils'). WELL DONE $130 (badge 'Our pick for most teams'): Gentleman's Box $129.99 ('2 AAA ribeyes, brisket bacon, hot Italian sausage, lean ground beef and 6 lamb chops'); A Taste of Greece Box $130 ('Gyro, four kinds of souvlaki, Greek and Macedonian sausage, pita, tzatziki and 32 mini spanakopita'); Steak Mania Combo $120 ('8 steaks: baseball, tenderloin, AAA striploin and ribeye'); Meal Butler Clean Week $130 [Concept] ('10 cooked meals plus egg bites, ready in minutes'). BIG THANKS $200: Long Weekend Box $199 ('8 AAA striploins, back ribs, sausages, burgers, sliders, buns and fries'); Greek Easter Table $199 [Concept, Mar 1 to May 1] ('Ontario lamb chops and a frenched rack, souvlaki, lemon potatoes and lemon chicken rice soup'). RESERVE $350 (brass accent): J&W Reserve Box $349 [Concept] ('2 Wagyu striploins, 2 AAA bone-in ribeyes, 4 AAA tenderloins, bacon-wrapped tenderloin, a frenched lamb rack and 8 Ontario lamb chops'). Each card has buttons 'Send this box' and 'Give as a certificate'. Extra real products not in catalog.js, copied from jw-catalog.json: steak-mania-combo 'STEAK MANIA COMBO' $120, img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/image_c1ab53ef-31ae-4c90-8330-4b39cc856b10.jpg?v=1648064567; bacon-wrapped-beef-tenderloin-4pack 'BEEF TENDERLOIN - BACON WRAPPED - 4x4oz PACK' $45, img https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1156/0176/products/images_1.jpg?v=1749578078."
            },
            {
              "name": "Three ways to deliver",
              "purpose": "Show J&W's route advantage and the certificate option",
              "content": "H2 'Three ways to deliver'. 1 'One drop at your office': 'Every box arrives on your route day in one stop, for one route fee. Please name someone to receive it, with a freezer or cooler nearby.' 2 'Straight to each home': 'We sort your list onto our weekly routes: Tuesday Durham, Wednesday Toronto and Mississauga, Thursday Halton and Hamilton, Friday York and Peel, plus long routes to Ottawa, London and more. Our usual route fee applies per address: $20, $27 or $35.' 3 'A Pick-a-Box certificate': 'Each person gets a code by email or a printed card. They choose a gift at their level and book their own route day, or pick up at 2201 Brimley Rd. Add delivery for $20 a certificate.' Footnote: 'Need it sooner? Express delivery in Scarborough, North York, Toronto, East York, Etobicoke, Richmond Hill, Markham and Vaughan: 1-2 business days, $30.'"
            },
            {
              "name": "Build your order (studio)",
              "purpose": "The self-serve builder: gift, card, people, review, ending in checkout or invoice",
              "content": "H2 'Build your order'. Progress: '1 Gift / 2 Card / 3 People / 4 Review'. STEP 1 'What are you giving?': level tabs, product tiles with photo and price, a 'Send a box / Give a certificate' toggle and a quantity stepper. STEP 2 'Make it yours': fields Company name; Logo (optional, stays on your device) or 'Use a monogram'; Message (240-character counter); Signed. Button 'Write it for me', with occasion chips Holiday / Client thank-you / Milestone / Greek Easter and 3 suggestions. Holiday suggestions: 'Thank you for everything you gave this year. Enjoy a great meal at home with the people you love. Happy holidays from all of us at {Company}.' / 'A year like this deserves a proper steak night. Thank you, and happy holidays. {Signed}' / 'From our team to your table: thank you for a great 2026. {Signed}'. Client: 'Thank you for trusting us this year. Dinner's on us. {Signed}' / 'Congratulations on your new home. Here's your first dinner in it. {Signed}'. Milestone: 'Five years! Thank you for all of it. Enjoy this one on us. {Signed}'. Greek Easter: 'Kalo Pascha! Wishing you and your family a happy Easter table. {Signed}'. Live preview: card with J&W laurel mark, the buyer's logo or monogram, the message, and 'Cut and packed for you by J&W Foods, Scarborough.' The certificate preview adds code JW-MRD-130-7Q4K and 'Choose your gift at jwfoods.com/pick'. STEP 3 'Who's it for?': three options, 'One office drop' (city select from JWC.cities() + receiver name), 'Upload a list' (CSV file input + 'Use our sample list (25 people)'), 'Email certificates' (paste emails + 'Use sample (40)'). Table columns: Name / City / Route day / Fee / Status. Per-day chips. Sample list: Tue GTA 1 Pickering, Ajax, Whitby, Oshawa ($20 each); Wed GTA 2 Scarborough x2, Toronto, Mississauga, North York, Etobicoke, East York ($20); Wed long Guelph ($35); Thu GTA 3 Oakville, Hamilton, Burlington ($27); Fri GTA 4 Markham x2, Richmond Hill, Brampton, Vaughan, Newmarket ($20); Fri long Ottawa ($35); flags: Calgary AB and Montreal QC ('Outside Ontario. Removed, you won't be charged.') and Wei J. with no address ('Switched to a Pick-a-Box certificate'). Route fees total $491. STEP 4 'Review': lines for gifts, volume pricing, logo cards (Free), delivery and total. Checkbox 'Send a gift record for our payroll team (name, date, value)'. Buttons 'Pay by card' (JWC.checkout) and 'Pay by invoice' (demo confirmation). Sticky bar: '{n} gifts / {box} / {total} / Continue ->'."
