          "note": "Setup ≈ $7,000: dietitian review of rules and macro database 12 h × $150 = $1,800; lab tests on top 10 SKUs ≈ $2,000 (shared with Play 1, count once); label-printing scale or thermal printer ≈ $1,500; 10 founding clients' first week free ≈ $950 food cost; staff training ≈ $400; launch reels ≈ $300. Monthly ≈ $3,200 at ~60 clients (≈ $2,700 average in year 1, ≈ $3,500 at 75 clients): coach desk ~8 h/wk ≈ $870; extra weigh-and-pack ~3.5 h/wk ≈ $370; labels ≈ $150; partner dietitian ≈ $600; InBody lease ≈ $300 (estimate; buying ≈ $10–15K); software (Claude API, Instagram messaging tool, client profiles) ≈ $250; Meta ads ≈ $700. Year 1 all-in ≈ $36K. Subscription app shared with Play 1; delivery on existing routes at the normal fee. Excludes Minastech's fee."
        },
