          ],
          "teamView": [
            {
              "name": "Coach desk · week of Mar 15, 2027 (sample)",
              "content": "KPI tiles: Conversations 186 (site 112 · Instagram 74) · Carts built 19 ($2,600) · Plan clients 29 enrolled, 26 active, 3 new, 2 paused · Scans booked 12 · Escalated to a person 7 (3 medical, 2 allergy, 1 age check, 1 complaint) · AI reply under 10 s, human reply 3.2 h. Plan economics card: '26 active × $170 = $4,420 this week · est. gross profit $1,990 · coach desk 5 h · pack time 2.3 h'. Demo orders placed on this page (JWC.orders() with proto 6, listen to jwc:order) appear at the top as new rows."
            },
            {
              "name": "Waiting for your OK (AI drafts)",
              "content": "Each row has Approve · Edit · Ask dietitian. (a) Re-plan after scan · Maria S. · drafted by Check-in and re-plan agent: '−1.6 kg in 4 weeks, body fat −1.1 points. Keep 1,610 kcal and 140 g protein. Thursday dinner Beef Flank Steak 195 g → Haddock Loin 255 g (−14 g fat).' (b) New plan · Dev P. · Macro Butler coach: '3,250 kcal, 185 g protein, Full Day · Performance $219. Covers his protein and about half his calories; suggest a daily Chicken Souvlaki Wrap ($5.99).' (c) Escalation · Instagram DM (name hidden) · Safety triage agent: 'Mentions type 2 diabetes and metformin. Holding reply drafted; route to partner dietitian.' (d) DM reply · Instagram DM concierge: 'Yes, Whitby is on our Tuesday route ($20, $100 minimum). Order by Sunday.' (e) Stock swap · Production sheet agent: 'Honey Garlic Salmon short until Thursday; swap 4 plans to Salmon Fillet 6oz (−$0.15).' Approving shows a toast and moves the row to 'Done today'."
            },
