                "Tap 'Continue to demo payment': JWC.checkout({ title: 'Snowhawks U11 AA fundraiser · team drop Wed Dec 9', extraRows: [{ label: 'Team drop, Wed Dec 9 (no fee, no minimum)', amount: 0 }], note: 'Team drop Wed Dec 9, 5:00–6:30 pm, team arena east lot. For Maya R. #14. $20.10 to the Snowhawks, paid by J&W.', onPlaced }) with no city, so delivery is free",
                "Place the demo order: raised counts up $456.12 → $476.22, orders 22 → 23, Maya 3 → 4 orders, toast 'You just sent $20.10 to the Snowhawks.'",
                "Thank-you card on the page: 'Thank you. The Snowhawks are at $476.22 of $750 (63%).' with 'Share with one more family' and a consent card 'Want $10 off your first regular J&W order of $100 or more? [Yes, email me the offer] [No thanks]. Demo: nothing is sent.' → toast confirmation"
