          "pricing": "Business gift boxes US$81–$212; 2026 holiday guide US$100–$180, shipped free. Choice certificate levels by quote. Lead-form spend buckets run from under $100 to over $250. Business Rewards tiers at US$5K, $20K and $50K a year.",
          "model": "Curated gift boxes and Choice certificates, where each recipient picks from a level and redeems online, by phone or by mail. Logo and message branding for qualifying programs, one order form and invoice for many recipients, pay-on-redemption for large programs, and a month-by-month holiday planning calendar.",
          "scale": "5,000+ business clients, 350,000+ custom gift certificates and 700,000+ coolers to business recipients since 2020 (company claim, 2025 data, verified on the live page Oct 16, 2026).",
