          "jwEdge": "Omaha does not ship to Canada. J&W already delivers across the GTA and Ontario on its own weekly routes for $20 to $35, with free pickup in Scarborough. It cuts in its own Ontario-inspected plant, has a Greek-Canadian family story back to the 1960s, and can gift clean cooked Meal Butler meals, a wellness gift Omaha cannot offer. Omaha's business ordering still runs on an emailed spreadsheet; J&W's studio is self-serve and sorts recipients onto route days as you type.",
