          "model": "A short stepper (birthday, sex, height, weight, activity, goal) sets editable calories and macros. Subscribers skip, pause, swap or edit up to 48 hours ahead (one business day in the UK), can book a 15 to 20 minute nutritionist call, and can bundle a gym membership.",
          "scale": "280K GCC customers and 18M meals (company claim; the global page now says 290K and 19M). 10M+ meals in 2024, 50%+ growth in H1 2025 and a US$64M Series B (Wamda, Jul 2025). Bought UK bespoke-macro brand Fresh Fitness Food in April 2025. No presence in Canada.",
